{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1745599480"}, "name":{"label":"DANNIexplodz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-15T13:12:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12424716408"}, "title":{"label":"It has potential"}, "content":{"label":"I see this being a great app for kids and even adults and even me, but I just can’t get over the fact that it kinda forces you into buying a subscription 😔 I had this app pre downloaded so maybe this will be fixed in the future but you can’t even block apps (the whole purpose) without buying a subscription  \n\nGREAT app idea if you feel like paying for a subscription though I’m just broke and am not feeling like spending money on apps. \nHope this helps!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
